	(text_box "U3 - nPM1300-CAAX\n\nPower Management IC (PMIC)\n\nIntegrated two buck regulators (VOUT1, VOUT2)\n\nI²C (TWI) interface for configuration and monitoring\n\nBattery charger support\n\nFuel gauge and power management functions\n\nVSET1, VSET2 used to configure VOUT1 and VOUT2 output voltages"
